    {
      "text": "whosoever slayeth Cain, vengeance shall be taken, Gen. 4:15 (Moses 5:40). To me belongeth vengeance, Deut. 32:35 (Heb. 10:30). I will render vengeance to mine enemies, Deut. 32:41. God, to whom vengeance belongeth, Ps. 94:1. execute vengeance upon the heathen, Ps. 149:7. he will not spare in the day of vengeance, Prov. 6:34. day of the Lord’s vengeance, Isa. 34:8. your God will come with vengeance, Isa. 35:4. he put on the garments of vengeance, Isa. 59:17. To proclaim … the day of vengeance of our God, Isa. 61:2. day of vengeance is in mine heart, Isa. 63:4. Lord … let me see thy vengeance on them, Jer. 11:20. declare in Zion the vengeance of the Lord, Jer. 50:28. time of the Lord’s vengeance, Jer. 51:6. I will execute vengeance, Micah 5:15. Lord will take vengeance on his adversaries, Nahum 1:2.",
